Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.57,0:00:16.49,TITLE2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(542,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.5\pos(627,154)} 要我坐以待毙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.49,TITLE2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(542,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.5\pos(523,154)} 我办不到
